# Keep the docker build context lean. Every Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so
# without this the context ships ~440MB of junk (bin/ 342MB, .git/ 92MB) into
# the VM on every image build — sustained I/O that has repeatedly wedged the
# Colima qemu VM mid-build.
#
# Deliberately KEPT in the context (images/handlers read them):
#   web/        — gateway image copies templates + static
#   migrations/ — embedded by cmd/migrate
#   docs/       — gateway serves docs/openapi.yaml from disk
#   profiles/   — seed reads YAML profiles

.git
bin
tests
python
.github
.claude
*.log
tmp
